                                "sense_id": "d1a44d9c-ddf7-3ed6-b642-7cfd630d69e5",
                                "text": "A Contract of eternall bond of loue,\nConfirm'd by mutuall ioynder of your hands,\nAtteſted by the holy cloſe of lippes,"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "f3dbf23b-e7a4-311f-9387-b5e8444e65bc",
                        "entry_id": "73fa022b-68ee-3241-b116-d9525421f4aa",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Of words or languages, proven to have existed by records."
